<title>USA: BTG Inc says completes buy of Nations Inc.</title>
<headline>BTG Inc says completes buy of Nations Inc.</headline>
<dateline>FAIRFAX, Va. 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>BTG Inc said Monday it has completed the purchase of all of Nations Inc's stock for $10 million in cash, and has refinanced about $2 million of Nations' bank debt.</p>
<p>Nations' is a privately held software and systems engineering company headquartered in Tinton Falls, New Jersey.</p>
<p>BTG reported revenue of $400 million in its last fiscal year, which ended March 31. Nations revenue for its fiscal year ended December 31, 1996 was $45 million.</p>
</text>
